{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial","kind":"proposition","title":"Partial closures: the $\\mathrm{Cl}_2$ pentagon and the Faddeev–Kashaev limit at the boundary","cites":["references/zagier1986","references/faddeev1994","references/kashaev1997"],"tags":["mathlib-filler","cl2-pentagon","faddeev-kashaev","boundary-case","lean-construction","partial-closure"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.PartialClosures.partial_closures_at_boundary","text":"cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial.md","leanSource":"cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial\"></a><p><em>The boundary cases of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Cl}_2</code> pentagon identity and the Faddeev-Kashaev quasi-classical limit are unconditional theorems:</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(2-boundary)</em> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Cl}_2(0) - \\mathrm{Cl}_2(0) + \\mathrm{Cl}_2(0) - \\mathrm{Cl}_2(0) + \\mathrm{Cl}_2(0) = 0</code> establishes the all-zero-input pentagon.</li>\n<li><em>(3-boundary)</em> For every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(q, n)</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1 - q) \\cdot \\log \\Phi_n(0; q) - \\mathrm{Li}_2(0) = 0</code> establishes the boundary case of the Faddeev-Kashaev limit at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x = 0</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"16.9.1","page":"b/prop-cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial","qa":{"counts":{"pass":86,"fail":0,"warn":3,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.Archimedean.PartialClosures.partial_closures_at_boundary","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/cl2-pentagon-and-faddeev-partial.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
